WEBVTT

00:01.060 --> 00:05.190
<i>Just 15 minutes into the first half, the reigning champions Nankatsu are in a pinch!</i>

00:05.190 --> 00:11.980
<i>Tsubasa is already no longer able to
use his super shot, the Drive Shot!</i>

00:13.370 --> 00:15.240
<i>This can't be...</i>

00:16.070 --> 00:17.740
Wakashimazu...

00:23.290 --> 00:24.600
Why did you avoid me?

00:24.600 --> 00:26.890
Wakashimazu, could it be...?

00:26.890 --> 00:28.220
I'm sorry.

00:28.220 --> 00:30.210
It seems my old injury has relapsed.

00:30.210 --> 00:31.380
What...?!

00:32.470 --> 00:34.170
But I'll be all right!

00:34.170 --> 00:36.530
It just stung a bit.

00:36.530 --> 00:38.680
I'll play until the end, like always!

00:40.640 --> 00:46.330
Even if I can only use my right arm, I will protect Toho's goal until the very end!

00:46.330 --> 00:47.870
So it's all right!

00:47.870 --> 00:49.570
Put your faith in me!

00:51.480 --> 00:53.240
Okay, everyone. Let's go!

00:53.820 --> 00:55.080
We'll attack!

00:55.080 --> 00:58.000
So as to not burden Wakashimazu, we'll go on the offensive!

00:58.000 --> 01:02.040
From this point on, Toho will relentlessly keep on attacking!

01:02.040 --> 01:04.540
Yes, Captain!

01:06.500 --> 01:07.640
Captain...

01:11.210 --> 01:13.920
<i>Ai! Ai! Ai!</i>

01:11.210 --> 01:13.920
<i>Love! Love! Love!</i>

01:14.840 --> 01:17.510
<i>Ai! Ai! Ai!</i>

01:14.840 --> 01:17.510
<i>Love! Love! Love!</i>

01:18.420 --> 01:21.130
<i>Ai! Ai! Ai!</i>

01:18.420 --> 01:21.130
<i>Love! Love! Love!</i>

01:28.020 --> 01:30.850
<i>moeru you ni hitori demo</i>

01:28.020 --> 01:30.850
<i>I kept running, lying to myself</i>

01:30.850 --> 01:37.110
<i>ikiteyukeru to usobuite hashiritsudzuketa</i>

01:30.850 --> 01:37.110
<i>that I could live alone, though the loneliness made me burn</i>

01:37.110 --> 01:42.990
<i>unubore no morosa wo kimi wa shitte ita no ni</i>

01:37.110 --> 01:42.990
<i>You knew how fragile my self-conceit makes me</i>

01:42.990 --> 01:49.580
<i>kokoro made uchinomasareta kono yoru ni</i>

01:42.990 --> 01:49.580
<i>In this night that even shattered my heart</i>

01:49.580 --> 01:53.580
<i>kimi no koe sagasu</i>

01:49.580 --> 01:53.580
<i>I hate how weak I am</i>

01:53.580 --> 01:58.090
<i>kono yowasa ga nikui yo</i>

01:53.580 --> 01:58.090
<i>yearning for your voice</i>

01:58.090 --> 02:03.680
<i>ima sugu torimodoshi ni ikanakya</i>

01:58.090 --> 02:03.680
<i>"I've got to get you back right now!"</i>

02:03.680 --> 02:05.220
<i>baka darou?</i>

02:03.680 --> 02:05.220
<i>I'm stupid, right?</i>

02:05.220 --> 02:06.430
<i>ai</i>

02:05.220 --> 02:06.430
<i>Love!</i>

02:06.430 --> 02:09.930
<i>kizudarake no ai wo shinjite</i>

02:06.430 --> 02:09.930
<i>Believing in my scarred love</i>

02:09.930 --> 02:19.820
<i>nagareochita namida sae mo tsuyosa e to kaete</i>

02:09.930 --> 02:19.820
<i>I will turn these shedded tears into strength</i>

02:19.820 --> 02:20.650
<i>ai</i>

02:19.820 --> 02:20.650
<i>Love!</i>

02:20.650 --> 02:24.450
<i>kizudarake no ai da to shite mo</i>

02:20.650 --> 02:24.450
<i>Even though it is a scarred love</i>

02:24.450 --> 02:28.450
<i>bokura no sekai wo tomoshiteru</i>

02:24.450 --> 02:28.450
<i>it lightens up our world</i>

02:28.450 --> 02:34.710
<i>kono ai mou ichibyou taritomo</i>

02:28.450 --> 02:34.710
<i>I will not let go of this love</i>

02:34.710 --> 02:37.540
<i>hanasanai</i>

02:34.710 --> 02:37.540
<i>for a single second!</i>

02:39.510 --> 02:44.430
<b><b>EPISODE 48:
THE CHAMPIONS - TOHO!</b></b>

02:42.370 --> 02:43.930
Okay, keep going!

02:43.930 --> 02:45.810
<i>It's time for Toho's counter-attack.</i>

02:46.230 --> 02:47.380
<i>That's right...</i>

02:47.380 --> 02:53.020
<i>We went this far without Hyuga thanks to our goalkeeper, Wakashimazu.</i>

02:53.580 --> 02:56.100
<i>He's only allowed a single goal up until now.</i>

02:56.100 --> 03:00.950
<i>As long as we had Wakashimazu, we felt safe knowing no one could score against us.</i>

03:00.950 --> 03:05.450
<i>That's why we've been able to keep on attacking without worrying about anything else.</i>

03:05.450 --> 03:08.830
<i>This time around, we will help Wakashimazu!</i>

03:08.830 --> 03:12.710
<i>The least we can do is ease his burden!</i>

03:12.710 --> 03:14.390
Let's do this, Nankatsu!

03:14.390 --> 03:16.500
We will definitely steal a goal from you!

03:16.940 --> 03:19.570
What's up with them getting suddenly all fired up?

03:19.570 --> 03:22.220
Just when our Tsubasa is injured...

03:22.220 --> 03:23.390
Shimano!

03:24.970 --> 03:25.510
What?

03:26.170 --> 03:30.770
<i>Tsubasa, despite being injured, manages to cut through this pass right in front of the goal!</i>

03:30.770 --> 03:31.770
Tsubasa!

03:31.770 --> 03:36.020
<i>The Drive Shot has failed, but my football is more than that!</i>

03:36.020 --> 03:37.360
Let's go, Toho!

03:37.360 --> 03:38.650
Our fire still burns!

03:38.650 --> 03:40.720
We'll follow Tsubasa's lead!

03:40.720 --> 03:41.530
Yeah!

03:43.090 --> 03:44.070
Hyuga!

03:44.070 --> 03:45.280
Tsubasa!

03:45.280 --> 03:47.290
I can't let you attack now!

03:47.290 --> 03:50.580
This time, you'll have to face me!

03:53.920 --> 03:54.810
What?!

03:54.810 --> 03:56.040
Th-this is...

03:56.040 --> 04:00.510
That's the move Tsubasa first used in the National Youth Football Tournament!

04:00.550 --> 04:03.840
It's the Heel Lift he learned from Roberto!

04:03.840 --> 04:04.970
<i>I won't let you...</i>

04:04.970 --> 04:06.140
<i>...have your way!</i>

04:07.640 --> 04:09.430
<i>He can't get past Hyuga!</i>

04:09.430 --> 04:11.480
<i>Hyuga turns this into an overhead pass!</i>

04:13.560 --> 04:14.400
Hyuga!

04:14.400 --> 04:16.610
We'll score another goal now!

04:20.160 --> 04:23.110
<i>They've beaten Morisaki, he can't reach it!</i>

04:23.740 --> 04:24.740
What?!

04:24.740 --> 04:25.740
All right, clear it!

04:26.660 --> 04:28.990
<i>Takasugi wisely clears the ball.</i>

04:28.990 --> 04:30.920
<i>Nankatsu barely scrape by this time!</i>

04:30.920 --> 04:32.750
Nice clear, Takasugi!

04:32.750 --> 04:36.580
<i>Tsubasa and Hyuga both chase after the cleared ball!</i>

04:36.580 --> 04:39.130
All right, let's get that ball, too!

04:39.130 --> 04:41.050
Leave it to me!

04:41.050 --> 04:44.620
<i>Hyuga really does tend to focus on his one-on-one duels.</i>

04:44.620 --> 04:46.680
<i>But that's part of what's charming about him.</i>

04:46.680 --> 04:49.970
<i>That's the very essence of what makes him Kojiro Hyuga.</i>

04:49.970 --> 04:51.590
Captain, we're counting on you!

04:51.590 --> 04:52.480
Yeah!

04:52.480 --> 04:56.980
<i>I really can't avoid facing off against Hyuga when we're playing against Toho.</i>

04:56.980 --> 04:59.230
<i>So, I will win against Hyuga.</i>

05:01.190 --> 05:04.110
<i>That will lead to Nankatsu's victory!</i>

05:06.600 --> 05:08.910
<i>Hyuga wins this exchange!</i>

05:08.910 --> 05:10.270
You did it, Captain!

05:10.270 --> 05:11.240
Tsubasa!

05:12.200 --> 05:15.120
<i>Tsubasa has fallen after losing his balance!</i>

05:15.120 --> 05:17.020
So, his leg hasn't healed after all...

05:17.020 --> 05:19.630
That's not Tsubasa's true jumping power!

05:21.260 --> 05:23.510
<i>If only my leg wasn't in this shape...</i>

05:24.170 --> 05:28.890
<i>Kojiro knows that Tsubasa's injured.</i>

05:28.890 --> 05:33.020
<i>But unlike what he did in his match against Misugi, he was able to keep looking ahead.</i>

05:33.020 --> 05:35.160
We will avenge Tsubasa!

05:35.160 --> 05:36.020
Yeah!

05:36.020 --> 05:37.360
<i>I won't lose!</i>

05:37.360 --> 05:41.110
<i>I won't lose to Tsubasa, to you, or to anyone else!</i>

05:41.110 --> 05:42.640
<i>If I lose today,</i>

05:42.640 --> 05:46.610
<i>everything I've done up to this point would've been meaningless!</i>

05:46.610 --> 05:48.570
Eat this, Hyuga!

05:49.880 --> 05:52.740
<i>Hyuga receives this attack head-on!</i>

05:52.740 --> 05:53.990
He won't even budge!

05:53.990 --> 05:56.370
That's what our Captain did to Nankatsu!

05:56.370 --> 05:59.830
But I can do that because of my body weight, y'know!

05:59.830 --> 06:01.710
Hyuga doing that...

06:01.710 --> 06:03.500
His lower body is incredibly strong.

06:06.150 --> 06:08.130
<i>Kisugi bounces off!</i>

06:09.340 --> 06:11.000
<i>Those tough and powerful legs</i>

06:11.000 --> 06:13.930
<i>that won't budge, even against the raging waves...</i>

06:13.930 --> 06:17.980
If one of us can't do it, we'll all go together!

06:17.980 --> 06:19.730
<i>It doesn't matter how many of you come!</i>

06:22.980 --> 06:23.990
<i>Eat this!</i>

06:23.990 --> 06:26.190
My Tiger Shot!

06:29.200 --> 06:31.240
<i>That explosive kick power,</i>

06:31.240 --> 06:33.080
<i>enough to break through raging waves...</i>

06:40.240 --> 06:42.540
<i>Morisaki is unable to react at all!</i>

06:42.880 --> 06:44.230
<i>2-1!</i>

06:44.230 --> 06:46.300
<i>Toho Academy is in the lead once again!</i>

06:46.970 --> 06:48.300
<i>It is truly amazing!</i>

06:48.670 --> 06:51.720
<i>The Tiger Shot has incredible power!</i>

06:51.720 --> 06:53.220
It's useless...

06:53.220 --> 06:54.720
This is...

06:54.720 --> 06:56.640
There's no way to stop it, y'know...

06:58.930 --> 07:00.740
<i>See that?</i>

07:00.740 --> 07:04.830
<i>This is the invincible shot that Kojiro developed in Okinawa!</i>

07:04.830 --> 07:06.940
<i>It's the Tiger Shot!</i>

07:06.940 --> 07:08.780
You did it, Hyuga!

07:08.780 --> 07:09.610
Nice shot!

07:09.610 --> 07:11.090
Captain!

07:12.120 --> 07:13.900
<i>Did you see that, Nankatsu?</i>

07:13.900 --> 07:16.240
<i>As long as I have this Tiger Shot,</i>

07:16.240 --> 07:18.120
<i>there's no way I can lose.</i>

07:18.120 --> 07:22.310
It looks like Nankatsu's dreams of V3 end here.

07:22.310 --> 07:23.550
Mr. Mikami...

07:23.550 --> 07:25.920
Nankatsu can't win this match.

07:27.170 --> 07:30.590
I can't tell how wide the gap will grow from here on out.

07:30.590 --> 07:36.550
Unless a miracle occurs, it's safe to say that Nankatsu has no chance at winning.

07:36.550 --> 07:37.640
You are right.

07:38.380 --> 07:40.630
Unless a miracle occurs, that's how it is.

07:43.760 --> 07:45.730
Football is all about scoring.

07:46.810 --> 07:48.900
If they score on us, we just have to score back.

07:48.900 --> 07:50.860
That's the very basis of this sport.

07:52.200 --> 07:56.200
Certainly, Toho is much stronger than any team we've faced so far.

07:56.200 --> 07:58.680
Hyuga's Tiger Shot is incredible too.

07:58.680 --> 08:01.290
But I refuse to give up until the very end!

08:01.290 --> 08:02.710
Tsubasa...

08:02.710 --> 08:04.790
Let's go, guys!

08:04.790 --> 08:07.350
Yes, Tsubasa's right!

08:07.350 --> 08:08.750
All right, let's do this!

08:08.750 --> 08:09.550
Yeah!

08:12.540 --> 08:15.760
<i>As I am now, I'm not able to play the way I want.</i>

08:15.760 --> 08:19.060
<i>Still, I'll just grasp at victory!</i>

08:19.500 --> 08:22.310
Am I clear? Don't get soft now!

08:22.310 --> 08:23.780
We have a one-goal lead now,

08:23.780 --> 08:26.780
but I have experienced this many times before.

08:26.780 --> 08:28.980
I'm talking about Tsubasa's hidden power

08:28.980 --> 08:32.200
that emerges when Nankatsu is in a pinch and completely cornered!

08:33.530 --> 08:37.120
Nankatsu will begin showing their true strength now.

08:37.120 --> 08:39.410
If we lose our focus now just because we're ahead,

08:39.410 --> 08:41.800
we once again won't be able to beat Nankatsu!

08:41.800 --> 08:42.910
Yes!

08:42.910 --> 08:44.610
We will definitely,

08:44.610 --> 08:46.550
you hear me, definitely,

08:46.550 --> 08:49.800
we'll definitely score the third goal before they can tie!

08:49.800 --> 08:52.800
We will score another goal!

08:56.340 --> 08:57.550
<i>The game resumes!</i>

08:57.550 --> 08:58.700
Okay, here we go!

08:58.700 --> 09:01.180
<i>Looking to score, Nankatsu begins their counter-attack!</i>

09:01.940 --> 09:04.940
<i>Toho's excellent as well, vigorously defending!</i>

09:06.760 --> 09:08.900
<i>Tsubasa steals the ball!</i>

09:08.900 --> 09:09.830
<i>Let's do this!</i>

09:09.830 --> 09:11.650
<i>They scored, so we should return the favor!</i>

09:11.650 --> 09:14.150
<i>I will be the one marking you!</i>

09:14.610 --> 09:16.610
<i>Tsubasa quickly sends a pass!</i>

09:16.610 --> 09:17.700
Watch out, Tsubasa!

09:18.970 --> 09:21.040
<i>Tsubasa evades him!</i>

09:21.040 --> 09:22.100
Damn it!

09:22.100 --> 09:27.290
<i>There really is something amazing about how much Hyuga and Toho are putting into this match.</i>

09:27.290 --> 09:31.050
<i>But we all have a dream too! Getting our V3 at the Nationals!</i>

09:31.050 --> 09:34.940
<i>And my dream of going to Brazil undefeated!</i>

09:34.940 --> 09:37.140
<i>There's no way I'd let go of it!</i>

09:37.140 --> 09:39.390
I won't let you catch up with us, Tsubasa!

09:41.380 --> 09:44.640
<i>That's right! No matter how great that shot is, a goal's still a goal!</i>

09:44.640 --> 09:47.150
<i>If they score against us, all we need to is to score back!</i>

09:48.750 --> 09:50.270
Tsubasa!

09:50.270 --> 09:52.570
<i>It's a perfect ball, headed towards Tsubasa!</i>

09:52.570 --> 09:54.040
Nice cross!

09:54.040 --> 09:55.320
Go, Tsubasa!

09:55.320 --> 09:56.900
<i>He goes for a jumping volley!</i>

09:57.380 --> 09:59.030
<i>Will this tie the score up?!</i>

10:01.150 --> 10:03.620
<i>Hyuga blocks it!</i>

10:13.950 --> 10:15.320
<i>He blocks it!</i>

10:15.320 --> 10:19.570
<i>Hyuga caught up with him. His speed is incredible!</i>

10:19.570 --> 10:24.520
<i>His lower body training in Okinawa didn't just give birth to the Tiger Shot,</i>

10:24.520 --> 10:26.020
<i>but has also shown itself here!</i>

10:28.140 --> 10:28.640
Damn!

10:29.260 --> 10:31.310
<i>Now, Tsubasa jumps for a header!</i>

10:31.310 --> 10:32.980
Like I'd let you score!

10:33.550 --> 10:36.210
<i>Hyuga stands way taller than Tsubasa!</i>

10:36.210 --> 10:38.110
<i>He is blocked once again!</i>

10:39.110 --> 10:40.620
Did you see that, Tsubasa?

10:40.620 --> 10:44.700
<i>Tsubasa can't even shoot against Hyuga!</i>

10:44.700 --> 10:47.700
If Tsubasa can't, we will shoot it!

10:47.700 --> 10:48.960
It won't go as you planned!

10:49.750 --> 10:51.420
<i>Wakashimazu clears the ball.</i>

10:52.000 --> 10:53.710
<i>The ball goes to Sawada.</i>

10:53.710 --> 10:54.870
That's it.

10:54.870 --> 10:56.090
Go for it Takeshi!

10:57.090 --> 10:58.090
Damn!

11:00.680 --> 11:04.220
<i>Tsubasa, that must be one hell of an injury.</i>

11:04.950 --> 11:08.100
<i>Although, apparently, so is mine...</i>

11:08.100 --> 11:10.350
Tch, his shoulder...

11:10.350 --> 11:15.290
<i>Takeshi Sawada, the Little Technician, dribbles his way up the field.</i>

11:15.290 --> 11:16.280
Sorimachi!

11:16.280 --> 11:17.920
<i>He's in front of Nankatsu's goal now!</i>

11:17.920 --> 11:19.900
<i>They've been caught completely off guard!</i>

11:19.900 --> 11:21.360
Damn it!

11:21.360 --> 11:23.700
<i>It's become a cross play!</i>

11:23.700 --> 11:25.540
<i>The ball rolls toward Nankatsu's goal.</i>

11:25.540 --> 11:26.790
I won't let that ball go in!

11:27.730 --> 11:29.460
<i>Ishizaki clears the ball!</i>

11:30.120 --> 11:30.920
Go!

11:30.920 --> 11:32.420
<i>Koike takes a direct long shot!</i>

11:34.420 --> 11:36.380
<i>Takasugi stops it and clears it again.</i>

11:36.380 --> 11:37.760
This third goal is happening...

11:37.760 --> 11:39.260
...over our dead body!

11:39.260 --> 11:39.970
Yeah!

11:40.270 --> 11:42.970
<i>Hyuga gets the ball.</i>

11:42.970 --> 11:44.720
Go, brother!

11:45.890 --> 11:47.180
Try blocking his shot!

11:48.140 --> 11:49.640
<i>He sends a pass!</i>

11:49.640 --> 11:50.430
What?!

11:51.940 --> 11:53.230
Send it here, Takeshi!

11:53.230 --> 11:57.440
<i>As Tsubasa had Misaki, Hyuga has me!</i>

11:58.110 --> 12:00.530
This is Toho's Golden Duo!

12:00.530 --> 12:03.230
<i>A brilliant combination play between Hyuga and Sawada!</i>

12:03.230 --> 12:05.030
<i>They are perfectly in sync!</i>

12:05.030 --> 12:07.030
Great pass, Takeshi.

12:07.940 --> 12:09.750
I'll be getting this third goal!

12:11.330 --> 12:14.040
I won't waste Takeshi's pass!

12:16.170 --> 12:18.510
<i>It's in, third goal.</i>

12:18.510 --> 12:22.170
<i>Tsubasa was blown away, and Morisaki's dive doesn't reach it!</i>

12:23.070 --> 12:24.620
<i>It's 3-1!</i>

12:24.620 --> 12:30.180
<i>Toho gets a 2-goal lead and pushes Nankatsu further away at the 22nd minute in the first half.</i>

12:30.180 --> 12:33.850
<i>Toho Academy has a 2 goal lead against Nankatsu, the reigning champions!</i>

12:35.110 --> 12:38.710
<i>Hyuga accomplishes a hat-trick just in this first half.</i>

12:41.150 --> 12:44.910
<i>Is it a victory sign showing his conviction on victory?</i>

12:45.580 --> 12:49.160
Tsubasa, it's just a 2-goal lead right now,

12:49.160 --> 12:53.240
it will become a 3, 4, or 5...

12:53.240 --> 12:55.500
Our lead will grow much larger from here on out!

12:57.170 --> 13:00.660
I know you're not in peak condition, right now.

13:00.660 --> 13:03.970
Regardless, I will win with a goal difference in hand against you!

13:03.970 --> 13:07.510
I will crush you and Nankatsu, through and through!

13:07.510 --> 13:11.470
I won't let anyone say that I can't beat you when you're in your top condition.

13:11.470 --> 13:12.980
Hyuga...

13:12.980 --> 13:16.000
<i>Kojiro is just like a tiger now.</i>

13:16.000 --> 13:19.170
<i>A cruel hunter that only aims for the goal.</i>

13:19.170 --> 13:21.970
<i>Kojiro Hyuga, the ferocious tiger.</i>

13:21.970 --> 13:23.150
<i>So strong...</i>

13:23.150 --> 13:25.490
<i>Hyuga's gotten so strong.</i>

13:25.490 --> 13:29.060
<i>I can't think of things like saving my Drive Shot for later.</i>

13:29.060 --> 13:37.700
<i>To be able to defeat Hyuga, I must play at my full strength, until this body of mine falls apart. I must give it everything I've got!</i>

13:37.700 --> 13:38.550
It's no use.

13:38.550 --> 13:40.130
We can't win.

13:40.130 --> 13:41.170
They are so strong.

13:41.170 --> 13:42.880
We are outmatched.

13:42.880 --> 13:45.880
Toho got this far, winning without Hyuga.

13:45.970 --> 13:48.800
Now they've added Hyuga to their squad, stronger than ever.

13:48.800 --> 13:51.650
Toho is a perfect team.

13:51.650 --> 13:55.480
That Tiger Shot looks practically unbeatable.

13:55.480 --> 13:58.810
I can't stop that shot.

13:58.810 --> 14:01.940
If only Wakabayashi were here now...

14:01.940 --> 14:05.330
Those who have no intention of fighting, please leave this pitch, right now.

14:06.430 --> 14:08.180
Tsubasa.

14:08.180 --> 14:12.090
Morisaki, Nankatsu's main goalkeeper is you.

14:12.090 --> 14:18.530
The one who protected this goal until now is not Genzo Wakabayashi, but Yuzo Morisaki.

14:18.530 --> 14:19.670
Tsubasa...

14:20.350 --> 14:25.670
Are you guys going to give up on our dream, just because we fell two goals behind?

14:25.670 --> 14:28.180
Our dream...

14:28.180 --> 14:30.500
Reigning over the country three times in a row...

14:30.500 --> 14:35.650
Isn't Nankatsu's V3 a dream that we created,

14:35.650 --> 14:37.810
that we found together, a dream of our own?

14:38.320 --> 14:39.700
Tsubasa...

14:42.440 --> 14:43.650
Tsubasa!

14:43.650 --> 14:45.820
I won't whine ever again!

14:45.820 --> 14:50.570
We can't give up on our dream this easily.

14:50.570 --> 14:53.330
You are injured yet putting this much effort.

14:53.330 --> 14:56.410
We will aim for the victory until the very end, Tsubasa!

14:56.410 --> 14:58.310
Our Captain Tsubasa!

14:58.310 --> 14:59.390
Guys...

15:00.380 --> 15:01.670
Okay, let's go!

15:01.670 --> 15:02.790
Yeah!

15:02.790 --> 15:05.780
You guys came back from a 3 goal lead in our match.

15:05.780 --> 15:07.630
Don't you lose, Nankatsu.

15:07.630 --> 15:09.470
It's about teamwork, Nankatsu!

15:09.470 --> 15:11.760
Stand against Hyuga, all together!

15:14.720 --> 15:15.770
Here we go, Toho!

15:15.770 --> 15:17.350
The battle starts now.

15:17.350 --> 15:20.600
This is our last match in middle school.

15:20.600 --> 15:24.220
Winning this match is our collective dream!

15:24.220 --> 15:26.730
We won't give up on our dream!

15:26.730 --> 15:28.740
Here we go, Toho!

15:29.580 --> 15:32.070
Go, Toho's Sliding Tackle Squad!

15:37.180 --> 15:38.080
What?!

15:38.080 --> 15:39.580
<i>As if we'd let you steal it!</i>

15:39.580 --> 15:41.080
<i>To start, let's take a goal back!</i>

15:41.080 --> 15:43.560
<i>Toho's Sliding Tackle Squad is defeated!</i>

15:43.560 --> 15:45.880
<i>Did Nankatsu's spirit awaken with this 2 goal lead?</i>

15:45.880 --> 15:47.000
<i>They sure are gutsy!</i>

15:47.000 --> 15:48.260
I won't lose!

15:48.260 --> 15:48.800
What?!

15:48.800 --> 15:50.880
<i>Hyuga intercepts Kisugi's ball!</i>

15:51.380 --> 15:54.430
<i>He gets ready to shoot, even from behind the center circle!</i>

15:54.430 --> 15:56.680
<i>It's the Tiger Shot!</i>

15:56.680 --> 15:58.680
<i>The Tiger Shot is a straight shot.</i>

15:58.680 --> 16:02.690
<i>If I stand right in front of Hyuga, the ball is sure to go there!</i>

16:02.690 --> 16:05.940
Eat this! Our lead will rise to three, now!

16:06.740 --> 16:08.690
<i>The Tiger Shot is launched!</i>

16:08.690 --> 16:10.610
I won't let you have that goal!

16:10.610 --> 16:14.000
<i>Tsubasa shoots the Tiger Shot back!</i>

16:14.000 --> 16:15.370
What?!

16:15.370 --> 16:17.490
Drive Shot!

16:28.180 --> 16:30.600
<i>H-he scored!</i>

16:30.600 --> 16:33.380
<i>It was a Drive Shot full of terrifying fighting spirit!</i>

16:33.380 --> 16:35.340
<i>Wakashimazu didn't so much as flinch!</i>

16:35.340 --> 16:37.340
<i>It went in.</i>

16:37.340 --> 16:39.120
You did it, Tsubasa!

16:39.120 --> 16:40.350
You did it!

16:40.350 --> 16:41.010
Yes!

16:41.010 --> 16:42.010
It's a one goal lead!

16:42.010 --> 16:42.850
You guys did it!

16:42.850 --> 16:44.810
He is so cool! So, so cool!

16:44.810 --> 16:45.690
Tsubasa.

16:48.190 --> 16:50.110
<i>That's... absurd...</i>

16:50.110 --> 16:51.740
So a miracle did occur.

16:51.740 --> 16:52.850
Yeah.

16:52.850 --> 16:55.120
I'm surprised he managed to return the Tiger Shot.

16:55.120 --> 16:59.170
He added spin to that ball and forced it to opponent's goal.

16:59.170 --> 17:03.910
The possibility of him succeeding was one in thousands—no, tens of thousands of times.

17:03.910 --> 17:08.100
Tsubasa Ozora is the boy who'd make that come true.

17:08.100 --> 17:10.880
He truly is a football prodigy.

17:10.880 --> 17:12.700
You are awesome, Tsubasa!

17:12.700 --> 17:15.560
Weren't you unable to fire Drive Shot anymore?

17:15.560 --> 17:19.620
This was the only option to defeat Toho and Hyuga.

17:19.620 --> 17:21.850
I didn't think it would be a goal, though.

17:21.850 --> 17:24.140
I just tried to block the Tiger Shot.

17:24.140 --> 17:28.230
We can't fight a half-hearted battle if we are to defeat Hyuga.

17:28.230 --> 17:33.240
From this point on in this match, I will destroy Kojiro Hyuga and Toho Academy

17:33.240 --> 17:37.490
with every ounce of strength I have left in this body, until it breaks!

17:37.490 --> 17:39.710
All right! We're giving it our all too, guys!

17:39.710 --> 17:41.700
Let's beat Toho's butt and get our V3!

17:41.700 --> 17:44.630
Let's make our dream come true!

17:44.630 --> 17:46.820
<i>This is Tsubasa's strength!</i>

17:46.820 --> 17:49.710
<i>The strength of Tsubasa's that I've been unable to beat.</i>

17:49.710 --> 17:51.580
Let's go guys!

17:51.580 --> 17:52.460
Hyuga.

17:52.460 --> 17:55.470
We are still one goal ahead.

17:55.470 --> 17:56.730
Dethrone Nankatsu!

17:56.730 --> 17:59.140
Let's aim for and claim Toho's V1!

17:59.140 --> 18:00.560
Yeah!

18:00.560 --> 18:03.260
<i>That goal right now totally got me.</i>

18:03.260 --> 18:06.370
<i>But this won't happen again.</i>

18:07.270 --> 18:13.190
<i>Tsubasa, next time, I will send your Drive Shot back with my Tiger Shot.</i>

18:13.190 --> 18:13.910
Go guys!

18:13.910 --> 18:15.190
Let's crush Hyuga!

18:15.690 --> 18:16.490
Oh–!

18:17.660 --> 18:18.860
Go for it, Sorimachi!

18:18.860 --> 18:25.080
<i>Hyuga, if this was the old you, you would've let it get to your head and tried to force your way to the goal.</i>

18:25.080 --> 18:27.540
<i>You are different now, though.</i>

18:27.540 --> 18:30.270
<i>Your passion and fighting spirit still burn,</i>

18:30.270 --> 18:34.590
<i>but now, you are able to make the
correct decisions necessary to win.</i>

18:34.590 --> 18:36.920
A good decision from Hyuga.

18:36.920 --> 18:38.310
True.

18:38.310 --> 18:39.000
Mr. Mikami.

18:39.000 --> 18:39.590
Huh?

18:39.590 --> 18:41.590
We'd like you to come to headquarters.

18:41.590 --> 18:42.720
Sure.

18:42.720 --> 18:45.300
Is it the meeting to organize the Europe tour?

18:45.300 --> 18:45.940
Yeah.

18:45.940 --> 18:47.480
I'll take my leave now.

18:48.420 --> 18:52.020
<i>Soon, the selection team is going to be formed after this tournament.</i>

18:52.020 --> 18:57.990
<i>Will the captain be Tsubasa Ozora or the all-grown Kojiro Hyuga?</i>

18:57.990 --> 18:59.950
Fight, Toho! Fight!

18:59.950 --> 19:02.320
Do your best, do your best, Nankatsu!

19:02.320 --> 19:03.240
Hyuga!

19:03.240 --> 19:07.370
<i>Toho successfully manage to get the ball to Hyuga near the goal!</i>

19:07.370 --> 19:08.160
Damn!

19:08.660 --> 19:10.870
<i>Tsubasa cuts the pass!</i>

19:10.870 --> 19:12.020
What?!

19:12.020 --> 19:13.530
<i>Hyuga, I won't lose.</i>

19:13.530 --> 19:16.050
<i>I will always be using my full strength from now on!</i>

19:17.420 --> 19:20.530
<i>Tsubasa breaks through the center of the field.</i>

19:21.430 --> 19:23.260
I won't let you pass anyone else!

19:23.890 --> 19:27.000
<i>Tsubasa jumps and dodges him!</i>

19:30.620 --> 19:31.600
What?!

19:32.610 --> 19:33.860
Tsubasa!

19:33.860 --> 19:37.190
<i>Tsubasa suddenly collapses!</i>

19:37.190 --> 19:38.900
Their attack is still on the move!

19:38.900 --> 19:40.530
Go and collect the ball!

19:41.490 --> 19:43.820
<i>Izawa collects the loose ball!</i>

19:43.820 --> 19:46.120
<i>Will he score the game-tying goal?!</i>

19:46.120 --> 19:47.580
Damn, eat this!

19:47.580 --> 19:48.580
<i>Izawa shoots!</i>

19:50.700 --> 19:52.620
<i>I can't hold up my left arm.</i>

19:53.380 --> 19:55.960
<i>Wakashimazu punches this away!</i>

19:55.960 --> 19:57.960
<i>Nankatsu weren't able to tie the game!</i>

19:57.960 --> 20:00.470
<i>Ken! So your left arm really was...</i>

20:00.470 --> 20:02.290
<i>But Tsubasa...</i>

20:02.290 --> 20:05.010
<i>Tsubasa lying on the ground is concerning!</i>

20:05.010 --> 20:08.430
<i>This must be the after effect of that miraculous Drive Shot.</i>

20:09.160 --> 20:13.260
<i>The recoil from taking that Tiger Shot and shooting it right back</i>

20:13.260 --> 20:16.650
<i>as a Drive Shot must have worsened the injuries to his body.</i>

20:16.650 --> 20:21.340
<i>Nankatsu has a corner kick, but Tsubasa is off right now to receive treatment.</i>

20:21.340 --> 20:22.500
Tsubasa...

20:22.500 --> 20:23.660
You hurt your leg again...

20:24.110 --> 20:27.150
Doctor, my leg suddenly started aching again.

20:27.150 --> 20:28.160
What did you expect?!

20:28.640 --> 20:30.540
The taping is all messed up!

20:30.540 --> 20:33.350
I've told you many times not to overdo it!

20:33.350 --> 20:39.050
Doctor, if I don't play with all my strength, I can't possibly beat Hyuga as he is now.

20:39.050 --> 20:42.800
I'm also standing on the pitch to win this match.

20:43.340 --> 20:44.690
Well, you can't finish the half.

20:44.690 --> 20:46.300
Let's go to the infirmary.

20:48.060 --> 20:49.340
Listen to me.

20:49.340 --> 20:51.890
We need to play harder, for Tsubasa's share, too.

20:51.890 --> 20:53.770
Let's make this chance count!

20:53.770 --> 20:54.690
Yeah!

20:54.850 --> 20:56.730
<i>They might not know it yet, but...</i>

20:56.730 --> 20:59.110
<i>...Wakashimazu's left arm is hurt.</i>

20:59.110 --> 21:00.730
<i>We need to step up...</i>

21:00.730 --> 21:02.860
<i>...and stymie their corner kick, somehow!</i>

21:02.860 --> 21:06.570
<i>Nankatsu resume the match without Tsubasa.</i>

21:08.580 --> 21:10.300
<i>He sends the ball high over the goal!</i>

21:10.300 --> 21:11.250
Let's go!

21:11.250 --> 21:12.500
Let's stop it!

21:13.660 --> 21:15.160
<i>It was a feint!</i>

21:15.160 --> 21:17.130
<i>The ball's for Ishizaki, running behind!</i>

21:17.130 --> 21:19.090
I've got ya!

21:21.380 --> 21:24.610
<i>It's been a while since he's tried to catch the ball. Don't tell me...</i>

21:24.610 --> 21:26.430
<i>Is Wakashimazu injured, too?</i>

21:26.430 --> 21:27.890
All right!

21:27.890 --> 21:29.390
<i>He shoots the loose ball!</i>

21:29.810 --> 21:31.140
<i>Imai clears it!</i>

21:32.390 --> 21:34.350
<i>The ball goes to Hyuga.</i>

21:34.350 --> 21:35.690
Fall back, guys!

21:35.690 --> 21:37.690
<i>Toho averts the crisis!</i>

21:37.690 --> 21:39.190
<i>It's looking like a fast break!</i>

21:39.190 --> 21:39.560
Wha–?

21:39.940 --> 21:40.690
What?

21:41.560 --> 21:43.630
Hyuga?

21:43.630 --> 21:45.950
Nankatsu without Tsubasa...

21:45.950 --> 21:49.450
Beating a Nankatsu in that state has no meaning.

21:49.840 --> 21:50.910
Hyuga.

21:50.910 --> 21:54.220
<i>However... I must fight!</i>

21:54.220 --> 21:59.040
<i>For the sake of everyone in Toho Academy who won this far without me.</i>

21:59.040 --> 22:00.580
Let's go guys!

22:00.580 --> 22:02.910
We will tear Nankatsu to pieces!

22:02.910 --> 22:04.770
If it's against Nankatsu without Tsubasa,

22:04.770 --> 22:06.770
then we'll beat them by ten goals!!

22:06.770 --> 22:07.550
Yeah!

22:07.550 --> 22:10.520
Tsubasa's absence is no excuse!

22:10.520 --> 22:12.570
We, too, are members of Nankatsu as well!

22:12.570 --> 22:15.060
We will defend this with the ten of us!

22:38.750 --> 22:44.800
<i>chotto are mi na ace ga tooru</i>

22:38.750 --> 22:44.800
<i>Hey, look over there at the ace passing through</i>

22:44.800 --> 22:50.800
<i>suguremono zo to machijû sawagu</i>

22:44.800 --> 22:50.800
<i>He's the best, and the whole town cheers him on</i>

22:50.800 --> 22:56.850
<i>chô-chô samba, zigzag samba</i>

22:50.800 --> 22:56.850
<i>Butterfly samba, zig-zag samba</i>

22:56.850 --> 23:01.480
<i>aitsu no uwasa de chamba mo hashiru</i>

22:56.850 --> 23:01.480
<i>Even little old ladies go around talking about him</i>

23:03.110 --> 23:07.780
<i>sore ni tsukete mo ore-tacha nan na no</i>

23:03.110 --> 23:07.780
<i>So, even if we have him, who are we?</i>

23:09.110 --> 23:15.200
<i>ball hitotsu ni kiri-kiri mai sa</i>

23:09.110 --> 23:15.200
<i>The ball spins round and round</i>

23:15.200 --> 23:21.250
<i>Dash, dash, dash! Kick and dash!</i>

23:21.250 --> 23:25.710
<i>itsuka kimeru ze inazuma shoot</i>

23:21.250 --> 23:25.710
<i>One day, I'll score with a lightning shot!</i>

23:27.010 --> 23:33.350
<i>son toki ore ga super hero sa</i>

23:27.010 --> 23:33.350
<i>When that happens, I'll become a super hero!</i>

23:33.350 --> 23:39.390
<i>Dash, dash, dash! Kick and dash!</i>

23:39.390 --> 23:45.690
<i>moete seishun kakenukero</i>

23:39.390 --> 23:45.690
<i>This fierce youth is on the field!</i>

23:49.900 --> 23:59.380
COMING UP, EPISODE 49:
BLAZING WARRIORS
THE FEROCIOUS TIGER AND TSUBASA
